    },
    {
      "id": "l5n-25kIa5icTjgTVZHlv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 333,
      "y": 1097,
      "width": 560.7994995117188,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1803937681,
      "version": 475,
      "versionNonce": 1646135679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791303109359,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Relational Databases (rows and columns, defined schema)\n    \n\nDocument Db (NoSql) - MongoDb\n\n\nWe own it:\n    - relational database? Use entity framework.\n\nWe don't own it:\n    - relational database? Dapper \n            https://www.learndapper.com/database-providers\n\n\nSql Server (latest version) - Polecat\nPostgres - Marten\n\n- you can do both in the same database - documents and schema stuff.\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Relational Databases (rows and columns, defined schema)\n    \n\nDocument Db (NoSql) - MongoDb\n\n\nWe own it:\n    - relational database? Use entity framework.\n\nWe don't own it:\n    - relational database? Dapper \n            https://www.learndapper.com/database-providers\n\n\nSql Server (latest version) - Polecat\nPostgres - Marten\n\n- you can do both in the same database - documents and schema stuff.\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t1upnLbAfVbd_TUoDMIe3",
